led to you. And our God and your God is one; and we are Muslims [in submission] to Him.\"","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"29:47","t":"And thus We have sent down to you the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān]. And those to whom We [previously] gave the Scripture believe in it. And among these [people of Makkah] are those who believe in it. And none reject Our verses except the disbelievers.","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"29:48","t":"And you did not recite before it any scripture, nor did you inscribe one with your right hand. Then [i.e., otherwise] the falsifiers would have had [cause for] doubt.","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"29:49","t":"Rather, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is distinct verses [preserved] within the breasts of those who have been given knowledge. And none reject Our verses except the wrongdoers.","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"29:50","t":"But they say, \"Why are not signs sent down to him from his Lord?\" Say, \"The signs are only with Allāh, and I am only a clear warner.\"","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"29:51","t":"And is it not sufficient for them that We revealed to you the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] which is recited to them? Indeed in that is a mercy and reminder for a people who believe.","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"29:52","t":"Say, \"Sufficient is Allāh between me and you as Witness. He knows what is in the heavens and earth. And they who have believed in falsehood and disbelieved in Allāh - it is those who are the losers.\"","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":52,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":41,"surahs":[29],"sajdah":false}